# kex: check-only
# `-`, `*`, `/`, `%` and `^` are for numbers. On a Bool, Atom or Char the
# operation was typed as its left operand and failed on both backends at run
# time; only a String was refused (found by `make fuzz-metamorphic`).

main do
  IO.printLine(:kex - 7)
  IO.printLine(true * :kex)
  IO.printLine(7 / true)
  IO.printLine(7 - 2)
  IO.printLine(7 * 2.5)
end
